From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlockMrTii <134159440+BlockMrTii@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:32:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Redstone limiter

Adds the hooks of the redstone limiter to the scheduled tick scheduler:

- LevelTicks: optional per-world time budget for the scheduled block tick
  phase with hand back of unstarted ticks, backlog-first drain order,
  admission of every scheduled tick through the group time accounts of the
  limiter (rejected ticks stay untouched in their chunk container).
- ServerLevel: owns the per-world limiter manager, measures block tick and
  piston block event cost, ends the limiter tick after the block events.

Everything stays vanilla while the limiter is disabled.

